    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\frac{5}{2}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x+2\\times4&=13\\\\2x+8&=13\\\\2x&=5\\\\x&=\\frac{5}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
